  "invariants": [
    "No NAV is published without an approval by a principal other than the preparer (UNB-NAV-008).",
    "Missing or stale inputs never produce a NAV; the run stays in exception or is suspended (UNB-NAV-046).",
    "A published NAV is never updated; corrections are linked restatements (UNB-NAV-038, UNB-NAV-042).",
    "Unit transactions strike only at a published NAV after their cutoff (forward pricing, UNB-NAV-021)."
  ]
